#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:18
msgid "China Expansion Help"
msgstr "中国扩展帮助"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:19
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\coffeeHelp.html:13
#| msgid "Coffee Help"
msgid "FCM Help"
msgstr "FCM 帮助"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:25
msgid ""
"These modules are from the Chinese kickstarter (Modian) release from "
"publisher Yikeguang (一刻馆). Splotter was unaware that these existed before I "
"contacted them! Therefore you could consider these modules as \"semi-"
"official\" but unsanctioned by Splotter. <br /> Games with these modules "
"will therefore be excluded from the stats (except Urban Planning / Urban "
"Planning Plus). <br /> The rules also don't cover all possiblities. "
"Therefore, I have made a few judgment calls to tighten up the rules a bit. "
"In addition, as this content was not designed by Splotter, I'm not sure the "
"playtesting/balancing was quite as thorough!"
msgstr ""
"这些模块来自出版方一刻馆的中国摩点众筹版本。在我联系 Splotter 之前他们并不知道这些存在！因此你可将这些模块视为“半官方”但未经 "
"Splotter 认可。<br /> 含这些模块的对局将排除出统计（城市规划/城市规划加强版除外）。<br /> "
"规则也未涵盖所有可能性，因此我做了一些判断来收紧规则。另外，由于内容非 Splotter 设计，我不确定测试/平衡是否同样充分！"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:37
msgid "Urban Planning"
msgstr "城市规划"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:38
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:63
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:90
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:135
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:177
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:220
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:40
msgid ""
"Random maps can have a huge amount of variance, producing isolated islands "
"as well as large residential areas. This module allows players to influence "
"map construction and thus the characteristics of the map to be used."
msgstr "随机地图差异可能很大，既会产生孤立岛屿也会产生大片住宅区。本模块允许玩家影响地图构建，从而影响所用地图的特征。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:48
msgid ""
"In turn order, each player may rotate the next tile to be placed, according "
"to the sequence below. Note you can only rotate the next tile - you cannot "
"select or change which tile that is."
msgstr "按回合顺序，每位玩家可按下列顺序旋转下一个要放置的板块。注意只能旋转下一个板块——不能选择或更换是哪一个板块。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:53
msgid ""
"After all tiles have been placed, turn order will reset to the same order as"
" when the game started."
msgstr "所有板块放置完毕后，回合顺序将重置为游戏开始时的顺序。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:62
msgid "Urban Planning Plus"
msgstr "城市规划加强版"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:65
msgid ""
"People have asked me in the past about some kind of map tile drafting "
"option. With the addition of the Urban Planning module, which only allows "
"players to rotate the next tile, I decided to add this option as well."
msgstr "过去有人问过是否有某种地图板块选抽选项。随着只允许旋转下一板块的城市规划模块加入，我决定也加上这个选项。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:73
msgid ""
"Same as Urban Planning, except you may now also choose which tile to place, "
"as well as the rotation."
msgstr "与城市规划相同，只是你现在还可以选择放置哪个板块及其旋转。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:78
msgid ""
"For 6p games then the expansion tiles will be added regardless of whether "
"New Districts has been selected or not."
msgstr "6 人局时，无论是否选择新城区，都会加入扩展板块。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:83
msgid "Jazz Musicians"
msgstr "爵士乐手"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:92
msgid ""
"Jazz originated in the United States in the late 19th and early 20th "
"centuries. This moving music caused people to linger longer. Whenever you "
"have such music in your restaurants, it will cause people to give more "
"generous tips."
msgstr "爵士乐起源于 19 世纪末 20 世纪初的美国。这种动人的音乐让人流连忘返。只要你的餐厅有这种音乐，人们就会给更丰厚的小费。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:100
msgid ""
"A Jazz Musician can be trained from a Waitress, and requires a salary. There"
" are 6 Jazz Musicians in the game."
msgstr "爵士乐手可由女服务生培训而来，需要薪水。游戏中有 6 名爵士乐手。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:105
msgid ""
"Each Jazz Musician will generate $15 in tips during the Dinnertime phase."
msgstr "每位爵士乐手在晚餐阶段产生 $15 小费。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:110
msgid ""
"Jazz Musicians act as a reverse tie-breaker; ie the person with FEWEST "
"musicians will win ties - so if you have any Jazz Musicians you will lose "
"ties to anyone with fewer Jazz Musicians."
msgstr "爵士乐手起反向平局判定作用；即乐手最少的人赢得平局——因此若你有任何爵士乐手，会输给乐手更少的玩家。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:123
msgid ""
"As always, employees need to actually be in your structure to count towards "
"tie breakers."
msgstr "一如既往，员工必须实际在你的组织结构中才计入平局判定。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:128
msgid "Delivery Drivers"
msgstr "配送司机"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:137
msgid ""
"Takeout! Takeout! Finally we can eat at home. Of course, the emergence of "
"takeout has made the price war more intense."
msgstr "外卖！外卖！终于可以在家吃了。当然，外卖的出现让价格战更加激烈。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:145
msgid ""
"The Delivery Driver is a base level employee that can be directly hired, and"
" requires a salary."
msgstr "外卖司机是可直接雇佣的基础员工，需要薪水。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:150
msgid ""
"Note that it is not a 1x employee, but you may only ever have one Delivery "
"Driver in your organisation."
msgstr "注意它不是 1x 员工，但你的组织中始终只能有一名外卖司机。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:155
msgid ""
"If a residence has 2 or more demand tokens on it, then any restaurant with a"
" working Delivery Driver will reduce the distance to 0."
msgstr "若住宅有 2 个或更多需求标记，则任何有在岗外卖司机的餐厅会将距离减至 0。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:160
msgid ""
"If you have a Milestone that reduces distance, and it is more favourable to "
"ignore the Delivery Driver, then the Delivery Driver won't be used. EG if "
"you are on the same tile as a house, and have the Ketchup Milestone, your "
"distance will still count as -1; you won't be penalised by having the "
"distance increased to 0 if using a Delivery Driver. So any net positive "
"distance will be reduced to 0."
msgstr ""
"若你有降低距离的里程碑，且忽略外卖司机更有利，则不会使用外卖司机。例如你与房屋同板块且有番茄酱里程碑，距离仍计为 -1；使用外卖司机导致距离变为 0 "
"也不会惩罚你。因此任何净正距离都会减至 0。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:165
msgid "Dumplings"
msgstr "饺子"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:179
msgid "Dumplings are one of China's classic foods."
msgstr "饺子是中国经典食物之一。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:187
msgid ""
"Marketing Dumplings: You cannot directly market dumplings. Instead, they are"
" so tasty that ANY marketed item will also add demand for dumplings. "
"Immediately after a marketing campaign has run, it will run again except the"
" second time it will add Dumplings demand instead of its original item."
msgstr ""
"饺子营销：不能直接营销饺子。相反，它们太好吃了，任何被营销的物品都会额外增加饺子需求。营销活动运行后会立即再运行一次，只是第二次增加的是饺子需求而非原物品。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:192
msgid ""
"The dumpling marketing happens immediately. So if billboards are marketing "
"item A and item B to the same house, the house will add demand for item A, "
"then dumpling due billboard A, and then item B. This would normally cause "
"the maximum demand to be reached, so the dumpling from advertising item B "
"would only be added if the house has a garden."
msgstr ""
"饺子营销立即生效。因此若广告牌向同一房屋营销物品 A 和 B，房屋会先加 A 需求，再因广告牌 A 加饺子，然后加 "
"B。这通常会达到最大需求，因此广告物品 B 带来的饺子只有房屋有花园时才会加入。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:197
msgid ""
"Dumplings are produced by Dumpling Cooks and Dumpling Chefs. There are 6 "
"cooks, each producing.3 dumplings. The chef Is a 1x employee, and will "
"produce 8 dumplings."
msgstr "饺子由饺子厨师与饺子主厨生产。共有 6 名厨师，各产 .3 个饺子。主厨是 1x 员工，将生产 8 个饺子。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:202
msgid ""
"There is a new Milestone for First Dumpling Sold. After Dinnertime, each "
"player who has gained this milestone will choose a new action for their CEO."
" Their CEO will lose its original action (Hire 1) and replace it with one of"
" the following: <ul> <li>2x Hire 1 Employee or $5 salary reduction (the same"
" as a Recruiting Manager)</li> <li>Get 2 training points; you may train one "
"employee by 2 levels (the same as a Coach)</li> <li>Reduce your base price "
"by $3 (the same as a permanent Discount Manager.</li> </ul>"
msgstr ""
"有新的“首个饺子售出”里程碑。晚餐后，获得此里程碑的每位玩家为 CEO 选择新行动。CEO 将失去原行动（雇佣 1），并替换为以下之一：<ul> "
"<li>2x 雇佣 1 名员工或减薪 $5（同招聘经理）</li> <li>获得 2 培训点；可将一名员工提升 2 级（同教练）</li> "
"<li>基础价格降低 $3（同永久折扣经理）</li> </ul>"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:213
msgid "Hawker Marketing"
msgstr "小贩营销"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:222
msgid ""
"Hawker trucks driving by, with their loud and engaging music, can't help but"
" attract people's attention to their goods."
msgstr "驶过的小贩卡车伴着响亮动听的音乐，不禁吸引人们对其货物的注意。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:230
msgid ""
"The Hawker Marketeer is a new marketing employee that can be trained from "
"the Marketing Trainee. The Hawker Marketeer requires a salary. There are 6 "
"in the game."
msgstr "小贩营销员是可由营销实习生培训的新营销员工，需要薪水。游戏中有 6 名。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:235
msgid ""
"The Hawker Marketeer has a range of 2 and is played in the same way as a "
"Cart Operator - you need to drive this marketeer out of a restaurant and "
"along roads up to a range of 2. You can choose campaign number #21 #22 or "
"#23, and a duration of 1, 2, or 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"小贩营销员范围为 2，玩法与手推车操作员相同——你需要将该营销员从餐厅开出，沿道路最远 2 格。可选择活动编号 #21 #22 或 #23，以及 1、2"
" 或 3 回合时长。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:240
msgid ""
"When the marketing campaign activates, it will advertise to any residence "
"directly connected to its route - <b><u>connections through parks or gardens"
" do not count</u></b>."
msgstr "营销活动激活时，会向与其路线直接相连的任何住宅做广告——<b><u>经公园或花园的连接不计</u></b>。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:245
msgid ""
"This is the only time the precise orientation of new houses actually "
"matters. Therefore, when using this module, the New Business Developer can "
"place new houses with the garden at the bottom/left/top/right, rather than "
"just horizontally or vertically."
msgstr "这是新房屋精确朝向真正重要的唯一时刻。因此使用本模块时，新业务开发商可将新房屋的花园放在下/左/上/右，而非仅水平或垂直。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:250
msgid ""
"To use a Hawker Marketeer, click the employee as usual. Then you can set a "
"route, and once you are happy, deploy the marketing campaign using the \"Add"
" Hawker Truck\" button. You must use all range if possible. If you need to "
"stop manually because the last tile contains a loop, click the \"Set Hawker "
"Route\" button again."
msgstr ""
"要使用小贩营销员，像平常一样点击该员工。然后设置路线，满意后用“添加小贩卡车”按钮部署营销活动。可能的话必须用尽范围。若因最后一格有环路需手动停止，再次点击“设置小贩路线”按钮。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMchinaHelp.html:255
msgid ""
"You can see the truck route by clicking \"Show Route\" in history, or "
"clicking the marketing token in the hawker marketing area (to the right of "
"the map)"
msgstr "可在历史中点击“显示路线”，或点击小贩营销区（地图右侧）的营销标记查看卡车路线"

