#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:38
msgid "What are the Expert Options?"
msgstr "什么是专家选项？"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:40
msgid ""
"Expert options appear in an orange panel. They are meant to allow players to"
" automate decisions that are obvious choices to make, and thus allow games "
"to progress a bit faster."
msgstr "专家选项出现在橙色面板中。它们用于自动完成明显的选择，让游戏更快推进。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:45
msgid ""
"You can select your preference for Order Of Business during restructuring. A"
" note is added in history as turn order is resolved if the decision was "
"automatic. Of course, it is very possible to select \"Earliest possible\" "
"and stll end up in last position - this just meant that everyone else had "
"more open slots or an earlier turn order than you, and also chose to go "
"early in turn order."
msgstr ""
"你可以在重组期间选择事务顺序偏好。若决定是自动的，回合顺序结算时会在历史中加注。当然，选“尽可能早”仍可能最后一名——这只意味着其他人有更多空位或更早的回合顺序，且也选择尽早行动。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:51
msgid ""
"You can select to autopay salary even if you don't have enough money, if you"
" do end up having enough money after dinnertime. Similarly, if you have the "
"Beer Milestone but no fridge, you can choose to pay in as much food as "
"possible, and then money. You also have the option of keeping all remaining "
"food if you have a fridge and end up with less than 10 items."
msgstr ""
"你可以选择即使钱不够也自动付薪，只要晚餐后钱够即可。类似地，若有啤酒里程碑但没冰箱，可选择先用尽可能多的食物付，再用钱。若有冰箱且最终不足 10 "
"件，也可选择保留全部剩余食物。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:57 .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:79
#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:82 .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:89
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "注意："

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:58
msgid ""
"Even if you select an expert option, you still might end up playing that "
"phase. For example, if you don't have enough money for salary, you will need"
" to fire someone, and so must play the salary phase. Also, if you end up "
"with kimchi plus other items, you will be required to play the Cleanup "
"phase. Game rewinds and player kickouts can also result in phases needing to"
" be played that you had selected to skip."
msgstr ""
"即使选择了专家选项，你仍可能需要游玩该阶段。例如，薪水不够就必须有人被解雇，因此必须进行薪水阶段。若最后剩泡菜加其他物品，还需进行清理阶段。游戏回退和玩家踢出也可能导致你本想跳过的阶段必须进行。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:64
msgid "Where do the scenarios come from?"
msgstr "场景从哪里来？"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:65
msgid "They are suggested in the Ketchup Expansion manual."
msgstr "它们是在番茄酱扩展手册中建议的。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:66
msgid "What is Sandbox Mode?"
msgstr "什么是沙盒模式？"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:68
msgid ""
"Sandbox mode is the answer to questions such as \"Can I have an option so "
"that new MS trainer gives a coach instead of a trainer?\" and \"What if the "
"1x employees were actually unlimited?\"."
msgstr "沙盒模式回答诸如“能否让新 MS 培训师给教练而非培训师？”以及“若 1x 员工实际无限制会怎样？”之类的问题。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:74
msgid ""
"Sandbox mode unlocks a panel under the player summaries allowing you to add "
"and remove employees at will on your turn."
msgstr "沙盒模式在玩家摘要下方解锁一个面板，让你在回合中随意增减员工。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:79
msgid "You must have 'Aid' turned on to view this."
msgstr "你必须开启“辅助”才能查看此内容。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:83
msgid ""
"This game will be automatically excluded from stats. There is no record in "
"History of using the Sandbox panel. There is no built in limit on anyone "
"doing anything with the Sandbox panel. Try to make it clear in the game "
"description what you are after if you select this option."
msgstr "本局将自动排除出统计。历史中不记录使用沙盒面板。沙盒面板操作没有内置限制。若选择此项，请尽量在游戏描述中写清你的目的。"

#: .\FCM\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:90
msgid ""
"Employees gained this way will not necesserily be saved if in the middle of "
"a simultaneous move (eg choosing reserve cards). But no worries, it's "
"Sandbox Mode. So just give yourself the employee again. If you gain an "
"employee this way during restructuring and place the employee in your "
"structure, then it will be saved."
msgstr ""
"若处于同时行动中途（如选择储备卡），以此方式获得的员工不一定能保存。别担心，这是沙盒模式，再给自己一次即可。若在重组期间以此获得员工并放入组织结构，则会保存。"

